# Pairs that may share code, each with its reason (scripts/check-copies.py reads this; "*" also matches "/").
# Corridor door-end records (2026-10-14): as-run research tools that made filed evidence. Their shared helpers
# move into one module only once each tool can be re-run and shown to give the same outputs
# (docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/landing/LANDING.md, "Copied code left for a later, main-wide job").
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  as-run capture drivers (crank, pulse, landing); each made different filed evidence
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  docs/research-2026-10/sources/*driver*.gd  as-run capture drivers share the older records' driver start-up
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  docs/research-2026-10/sources/walk-rig-rejected-2026-10-10/godot/*.gd  as-run capture drivers share the older records' driver start-up
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  docs/research-2026-10/sources/cage-design-2026-10-11/option-c/driver/design_opening.gd  as-run capture drivers share the older records' driver start-up
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  scripts/parity/*.gd  as-run capture drivers share the parity tools' start-up; merging needs a re-run
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  apps/game/tests/companion_rules_test.gd  as-run capture drivers carry the suites' _tap; merging needs a re-run
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  apps/game/tests/wolf_space_test.gd  as-run capture drivers carry the suites' _tap; merging needs a re-run
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/crank/tools/run_codex.sh  docs/research-2026-10/sources/walk-2026-10-11/tools/run_codex.sh  as-run Codex job script; its prompt made filed art
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/door/tools/cleanup7.py  docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/fix1/door/tools/cleanup8.py  as-run cleanup generations; each made a different filed round
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/door/tools/codex_inputs7.py  docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/fix1/door/tools/codex_inputs8.py  as-run Codex input builders; each made a different filed round
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/door/tools/portal7.py  docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/fix1/door/tools/portal8.py  as-run portal generations; each made a different filed round
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/fix1/door/tools/portal8.py  docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/fix2/door/tools/cut9.py  as-run door tools; cut9 is imported by round 10's tools as filed
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/fix3/door/tools/install10.py  docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-door-end-2026-10-12/tools/layers/install4.py  as-run installers of two records
docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-additions-2026-10-14/fix4/codex/run_job.sh  docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-door-end-2026-10-12/tools/codex/run_job.sh  as-run Codex job scripts of two records
# Doors records (2026-10-14): as-run research tools and capture drivers that made filed evidence, one
# current copy of each (README "Tool map"). Their shared helpers move into one module only once each tool
# can be re-run and shown to give the same outputs (docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/landing/NOTES.md, "Copies left").
docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/*  docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/*  as-run doors tools; each round's tool made its own filed evidence
docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/*  docs/research-2026-10/sources/corridor-door-end-2026-10-12/tools/*  as-run doors design tools started from the corridor door end's portal model
docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  docs/research-2026-10/sources/*driver*.gd  as-run capture drivers share the older records' driver start-up
docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  docs/research-2026-10/sources/walk-rig-rejected-2026-10-10/godot/*.gd  as-run capture drivers share the older records' driver start-up
docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  docs/research-2026-10/sources/cage-design-2026-10-11/option-c/driver/design_opening.gd  as-run capture drivers share the older records' driver start-up
docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  scripts/parity/*.gd  as-run capture drivers share the parity tools' start-up; merging needs a re-run
docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  apps/game/tests/companion_rules_test.gd  as-run capture drivers carry the suites' _tap; merging needs a re-run
docs/research-2026-10/sources/doors-2026-10-14/*_capture.gd  apps/game/tests/wolf_space_test.gd  as-run capture drivers carry the suites' _tap; merging needs a re-run
